yy
Swelling
yy
Deformity
yy
Night sweats
yy
Low grade fever
yy
Chronic cough
yy
Weight loss
Signs
yy
Swelling
yy
Tenderness 
yy
Deformities
yy
Discharging sinuses
yy
Cold abscesses
yy
Muscle wasting
Investigations
yy
Chest X-Ray to rule out pulmonary TB
yy
X-ray of the suspected part
yy
Sputum/gastric washings for AFBs
yy
FBC, ESR
yy
MRI of suspected parts (if available) 
yy
Bone and soft tissue biopsy for culture and histology
yy
Mantoux test 
Treatment 
Treatment objectives
yy
Eradicate infection
yy
Prevent and correct deformity
yy
Prevent stiffness
Non-pharmacological treatment
yy
Physiotherapy
yy
Splints/corsets/body jackets'),
