yy
Immobilization/splinting of the affected limb. Do not move the limb 
that has been bitten - the more it is moved, the faster the poison 
spreads.  Carry the person on a stretcher and tie the limb to a straight 
piece of wood. If ice is available, wrap pieces in cloth and place it 

