HUMAN BITES
Human bites (which usually occur during fights) lead to infections, 
which if neglected, almost invariably produce a highly destructive, 
necrotizing lesion contaminated by a mixture of aerobic and anaerobic 
organisms. A deliberately inflicted bite on the hand or elsewhere should 
be considered as contaminated.
